## Remaining work

Request 3004 is closed for the nullable response states described above.
`getAcl` and the four ACL management/list APIs remain unimplemented. Broader
Phase 18 settings, input, error, control-flow, reverse-export, and platform
reconciliation also remains open. No Broker, Docker, or remote CI was used.
Pre-existing Phase 19 worktree paths remain unstaged and outside this slice.
